        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "6afdd202-eed7-3c68-958a-4f003252a7f9",
                "word": "отнюдь",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "64bcab13-ce96-31aa-8865-563f830d7584",
                        "entry_id": "6afdd202-eed7-3c68-958a-4f003252a7f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "вовсе, совсем (нет), никоим образом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aafd363b-b8ca-458b-af32-6eb11a91b112",
                                "sense_id": "64bcab13-ce96-31aa-8865-563f830d7584",
                                "text": "Я даже думаю бросить роман и придумать повесть поскорее, так, что-нибудь лёгонькое и грациозное и отнюдь без мрачного направления… Это уж отнюдь… Все должны веселиться и радоваться!.."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9974a1a0-3d31-3de2-9a1c-5f0bd2446f33",
                        "entry_id": "6afdd202-eed7-3c68-958a-4f003252a7f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. совершенно, полностью, вообще ."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bab3613e-64cf-4bdf-be2f-8e736e9d3907",
                                "sense_id": "9974a1a0-3d31-3de2-9a1c-5f0bd2446f33",
                                "text": "Также кто из приезжих и иноземцов хотя и неявленные товары имеют а продают противно прежних указов в домах своих и в прочих неуказных местах, тем продавать людям того города жителям оптом, а в розницу отнюдь не продавать, а кто в том явятся виновны, и с таким поступлено будет по выданным же и публикованным прежним указам."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0422029c-05f0-403c-8ee3-bf3bed948367",
                        "source_entry_id": "6afdd202-eed7-3c68-958a-4f003252a7f9",
                        "target_lang_word": "by no means",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "by no means",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                        "entry_id": "e2f725b2-deac-3699-b716-0da83251cb7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Certainly not; definitely not; not at all."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d03f76fd-1377-414e-8310-a27e6e1dc12f",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "By no means am I suggesting that euthanasia should be outlawed, but rather that we should look at its inherent risks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27e0dcec-7703-4665-896e-779bddc8a253",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "Is that all you’ve got to say? ―By no means. Let me explain further."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b863a6c1-5a8a-4b44-9615-46940639827a",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "For the Maine Garden, I doe not Deny, but there ſhould be ſome Faire Alleys, ranged on both Sides, vvith Fruit Trees; And ſome Pretty Tufts of Fruit Trees, And Arbours vvith Seats, ſet in ſome Decent Order; but theſe to be, by no Meanes, ſet too thicke; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc1586f7-0da5-4ef7-89bc-eda268224238",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "I was last night at the Funeral, where a confident lover in the play, speaking of his mistress, cries out—\"Oh that Harriot! to fold these arms about the waist of that beauteous, struggling, and at last yielding fair!\" Such an image as this ought by no means to be presented to a chaste and regular audience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e74d7acf-0078-45a1-943a-4aaeb0a1f2b2",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "Cecilia, thanking him for the offer, ſaid ſhe meant novv to make her acknovvledgments for all the trouble he had already taken, but by no means purpoſed to give him any more."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "289a27a9-9b35-4f4a-9265-37569db57c20",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "It is by no means as the greatest of poets that Goethe deserves the pride and praise of his German countrymen. It is as the clearest, the largest, the most helpful thinker of modern times."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c62275f5-c106-44f7-86f7-6bf27759106b",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "[S]he was by no means tender-hearted or easily accessible to the feelings of others, like most country-bred people, who always retain in their souls something of the horny hardness of the paternal hands."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5e2b454-e9c2-48fe-abd3-5488c8079500",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "The compilers of the volume may very naturally have been tempted to strain a point so as to admit some specimen from the hand of the most potent if by no means the most perfect of English poetesses [Elizabeth Barrett Browning]: but in that case they would have done much better, in my humble opinion, to select the beautiful and simple memorial stanzas, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b465e54a-522d-4da9-bd18-20fa3614d0f0",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "He wrote to her the next day, sent her a five-pound note, and at the end of his letter said that if she were very nice and cared to see him for the week-end he would be glad to run down; but she was by no means to alter any plans she had made."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1c269d4-e16d-467f-a0a2-9f90ed69f21d",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "Every photographer of experience has his own theories and methods of working, but for the last 14 years I have used a Leica exclusively, and have found it best adapted to the somewhat exacting demands of railway photography, which is by no means an easy branch of the art."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0956b9e-54b5-444e-b14e-4b1d0e742adc",
                                                "sense_id": "cb5b1270-1349-397b-8ea0-6adb94e897f3",
                                                "text": "Well, during our short staycation at Humberston Fitties, just south of Cleethorpes, we cycled through the very unspoilt Lincolnshire Wolds, which are by no means flat and boring as conventional wisdom about the county suggests."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ca9be0e6-2296-443f-b1cc-2b8ceb8e4eec",
                        "source_entry_id": "6afdd202-eed7-3c68-958a-4f003252a7f9",
                        "target_lang_word": "not at all",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "not at all",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86b2b8ba-7b29-3261-992a-0bcfae6731d4",
                                        "entry_id": "13cd7b52-1353-35ab-9faa-af4f635eb8e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not even a tiny bit; not in any way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "emphatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25bd2e97-9100-490e-90ce-eb3aa5bb9bd8",
                                                "sense_id": "86b2b8ba-7b29-3261-992a-0bcfae6731d4",
                                                "text": "He's not at all friendly towards his ex-wife."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6365ab1e-faed-4d2a-867f-b9ce60b6418b",
                                                "sense_id": "86b2b8ba-7b29-3261-992a-0bcfae6731d4",
                                                "text": "Now all this was very fine, but not at all in keeping with the Celebrity's character as I had come to conceive it. The idea that adulation ever cloyed on him was ludicrous in itself. In fact I thought the whole story fishy, and came very near to saying so."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "not at all",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "788865a7-9aa6-3b70-bb66-d83c18649c06",
                                        "entry_id": "a64618d1-9bd6-310a-97b2-0dafb2959a45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used similarly to you're welcome, as a conventional reply to an expression of gratitude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28d09cce-6a33-453e-9735-af0558f857df",
                                                "sense_id": "788865a7-9aa6-3b70-bb66-d83c18649c06",
                                                "text": "—Thank you for coming. —Not at all. Thank you for having me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de233458-5be5-32bf-b158-ead8ca605629",
                                        "entry_id": "a64618d1-9bd6-310a-97b2-0dafb2959a45",
